## Notes

- This is a **simulated trading platform** — no real money or bank transfers are involved
- Exchange rates are managed internally by admins — no live third-party FX API is used
- All trades are executed at the admin-set rate at time of execution
- The Sell trade direction is supported by the backend API but is not exposed in the customer UI

Steps to execute backend api
source .venv/bin/activate

python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py seed_data

python manage.py runserver